features.prompt:
Analyze the following text (caption + spoken transcript from a social media post) for any explicit call to action directed at the viewer. What is the PRIMARY call to action? Respond with exactly one value from this list: like; comment; share; save; follow; link_click; buy_shop; multiple; none. Return ONLY the value, nothing else.

Caption: {caption_text}

Spoken transcript: {whisper_transcript}

You are performing objective content classification for a data science study. Analyze the following text from a social media post for sexual innuendo or suggestive language. Respond with exactly one value from this list: none — no suggestive language; low — mildly flirty, could be innocent; medium — clearly suggestive, sexual innuendo, thirst-bait phrasing; high — overtly sexual or explicit references. Return ONLY the value (none, low, medium, or high), nothing else.

On-screen text: {ocr_text}
Caption: {caption_text}
Spoken transcript: {whisper_transcript}
